dict(id="a1-breakfast", level="A1", title="Breakfast Time", tr="Kahvaltı Vakti", text="""
Every morning, the Yılmaz family eats breakfast together. They sit at a big table in the kitchen.

Mum makes tea, and Dad cuts the bread. There is cheese, olives, tomatoes, cucumbers and eggs on the table. There is also honey and butter. Little Ada loves honey. She puts it on her bread every day.

On weekdays, breakfast is at seven o'clock. It is short because everyone is busy. Dad goes to work, and the children go to school.

But on Sundays, breakfast is long and slow. Grandma and Grandpa come, and everyone talks and laughs for two hours. Sunday breakfast is the favourite meal of the week.
"""),
dict(id="a1-bike", level="A1", title="The Red Bike", tr="Kırmızı Bisiklet", text="""
Omar is nine years old. For his birthday, his parents give him a red bike. It is shiny and new, and it has a small bell.

Omar can't ride a bike yet. On Saturday, his father takes him to the park. "Don't worry," says his father. "I am here."

The first time, Omar falls. His knee hurts a little, but he doesn't cry. He tries again and again. His father holds the bike and runs next to him.

After an hour, his father {lets go}. Omar doesn't know! He rides alone to the end of the path. Then he looks back and sees his father far away.

Omar shouts, "I can do it!" He is very proud. Now he rides his red bike every day.
"""),
dict(id="a1-teacher", level="A1", title="A New Teacher", tr="Yeni Öğretmen", text="""
Today there is a new teacher in Ayşe's class. Her name is Julia, and she is from Ireland. She is young, and she has long red hair.

Julia teaches English. Her lessons are fun. The students sing songs, play games and draw pictures. They speak only English in class, but Julia speaks slowly, so everyone understands.

Ayşe is shy. She usually doesn't talk in class. But today Julia asks her a question: "What is your favourite animal?" Ayşe thinks for a moment. "My favourite animal is the horse," she says quietly.

Julia smiles and says, "Great answer!" Ayşe is happy. Maybe English is not so difficult.
"""),
dict(id="a1-doctor", level="A1", title="At the Doctor's", tr="Doktorda", text="""
Mert doesn't feel well. He has a headache and a {sore throat}, and he is very hot. His mother calls the doctor and makes an appointment.

At ten o'clock, they go to the doctor. The {waiting room} is full of people. Mert reads a magazine, but he is tired.

Then a nurse calls his name. The doctor is a kind woman with glasses. She looks in his mouth and listens to his chest. "You have a cold," she says. "Drink a lot of water, take this medicine and stay in bed for three days."

Mert goes home and sleeps all afternoon. His mother makes hot soup with lemon. After three days, he feels much better, and he goes back to school.
"""),
dict(id="a1-grandpa", level="A1", title="My Grandfather's Garden", tr="Dedemin Bahçesi", text="""
My grandfather lives in a small village. He has a big garden behind his house. He works in the garden every day, from early morning to the evening.

In his garden, there are apple trees, cherry trees and a lot of vegetables. In summer, there are tomatoes, peppers, beans and cucumbers. He also has three chickens. They give him fresh eggs every morning.

I visit him every summer, and I help him in the garden. We water the plants and pick the fruit. My grandfather tells me the names of all the plants. He knows everything about them.

In the evening, we sit under the cherry tree and eat fruit. It is quiet, and the air is fresh. I love my grandfather's garden. It is my favourite place in the world.
"""),
